B13 sits in the "Units" row under the Community column. C13 (the LH column next to it) uses `=IF(LH_OI="Yes",COUNTIF(LH_Sites,">0"),"")`. B14 already checks `Community_OI="Yes"` the same way. So B13 most likely mirrors C13 for the Community side.

