The block at F9:I11 looks like a lookup table. It has Year in G and CW in H, with a "Start" row (10) and an "end" row (11). The "Match" header in I9 suggests each row should return the position in the data (A3:B58) where both the calendar week and the year match. I'm assuming that intent from the headers.

